be sealed away. What coulda caused this?</i>

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.060
<i>It's 'cause they used Divine Possession!</i>

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:51.110
<i>That technique melds the minds of 
a tsugumomo an' their wielder.</i>

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.450
<i>Did their memories get mixed up, too?</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:01.010
So... what happened after that?

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:03.790
Well, the dream ended there.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:10.750
But something about the lady with 
the black obi felt really familiar.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.630
<i>He's gonna get back the memories we 
went to the trouble of lockin' away!</i>

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.530
<i>I gotta tell Kiriha to avoid 
usin' Divine Possession!</i>

