00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:48.790
Sunao's father \h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
<b>Sumeragi Susumu</b>

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.000
Sunao-chan!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.840
