00:01:56.840 --> 00:02:00.170
No pulled muscles?! No broken bones?!

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:01.810
Let's get you to a hospital ASAP!

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.410
Susumu-san.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:08.560
You cannot baby her.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.810
The inheritor of the Sumeragi 
school has to be better than this.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:11.810
Sunao's mother\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
<b>Sumeragi Suzuri</b>

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.070
Cut her some slack!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.580
Sunao-chan's already tuckered out!

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.450
It's all right, Father.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.360
Mother is right...

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.660
S-Sunao-chan?

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:31.560
<b>Sumeragi School</b>

