Tsuka Habaki!

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.990
Sunao-chan!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.830
I want to apologize for how rude I've been.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:50.060
Well, your tune certainly has changed.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.160
The duel the other day...

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:58.630
That was something I one-sidedly 
forced Kazuya-kun into.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.030
But after being beaten by the two of you,

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:06.170
I realized how misguided I was.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:13.960
And now, I'm embarrassed about 
the way I've been behaving.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.800
Well, you swore vengeance on 
Kanaka after she saved your life,

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.720
a vendetta you then sought 
to take out on Kazuya,

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:28.100
to say nothing of your insults toward me, 
another who helped save your life.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.770
What a pitiful brain you must have.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.620
I'm sorry. When my temper 
gets going, I just...

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.350
Incidentally, what's become of Kotetsu?

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:44.530
A swordsmith is repairing his grip.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.740
The blade itself didn't take any damage.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.180
That's a relief.

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.000
Yes.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.180
I need to apologize to him, as well.

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:01.150
When I was little, I blamed 
Kotetsu for my brother's death.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.970
I didn't want to admit that 
the amasogi was stronger,

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.520
so I laid all the blame on Kotetsu and 
treated him coldly, like a mere tool.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:16.150
But Kazuya-kun made me realize 
how wrong I was about it all.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.810
The amasogi that struck down your brother

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.530
was a match for someone as fierce 
as Kanaka, despite its injuries.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.140
A typical malison exorcist 
would have stood no chance.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.300
You can take pride in that.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.790
Right.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.180
Kiriha-sama...

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.350
What is it?

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:38.170
The reason I asked you here 
is because I had a question

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:42.340
that I doubt you would want 
to answer around Kazuya-kun.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.800
About Kanaka, then...

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.620
Right. How did Kanaka-sama pass away?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.370
Was she sick, or was it 
some kind of accident?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.560
No.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.940
Kanaka was possessed by an amasogi.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.970
Then she...

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:01.190
Right.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.030
I killed Kanaka.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:10.530
<b>Marriage: A promise to spend 
your life with someone.</b>

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:13.630
<b>Even a verbal agreement will 
