00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:50.470
<b>Chapter 2</b>

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:50.470
<b>The False Fiancée</b>

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.890
"The False Fiancée."

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:56.530
Talk about fancy.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.890
I came over since Sunao-san asked me to, but...

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.030
<i>I can't take another step.</i>

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:15.230
<i>Every one of my senses is 
warning me of imminent danger.</i>

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:24.420
You'll pay! For harming my darling 
Sunao-chan with those filthy mitts,

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:29.050
and not only that, but what's more...

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.220
Susumu-san.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.100
<i>It's gone?</i>

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:39.780
<i>That ominous feeling just vanished...</i>

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:47.440
Thank you for coming. 
I'm Sunao's mother, Sumeragi Suzuri.

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:51.030
H-Hello! I'm Kagami Kazuya.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.220
I'm sorry if my daughter 
troubled you the other day.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.110
Oh, not at all!

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.490
Please, come right in.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.650
Sure.

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:02.580
Pardon m—

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.580
...eee?!

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:08.090
Oh, excuse me. We made a bit of a mess.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.710
<b>Suzuri</b>

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:08.710
A bit?!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.710
Right this way, please.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.170
O-Okay...

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:26.610
Th-Thank you for coming... Kazuya-sama.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.610
Kazuya-sama?!

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.350
Please, take your time.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.930
Your mom is really pretty.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.750
On the outside, sure.

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.380
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.380
I talked to Kiriha-sama.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.760
About how you attract 
supernatural aberrations...

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:58.150
And how you work as a malison exorcist 
to atone for the damage that causes.

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.140
She also—

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.010
Not a word to anyone else.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:11.300
My point is, I let my emotions get out of 
control, and I insulted and attacked you.

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:13.780
I'm sorry about that.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:18.660
Plus... you helped me realize 
something important.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:21.290
Tsukumogami aren't tools.

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.290
They're our partners!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:27.920
So... thank you.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:32.630
What?

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:38.890
I thought you were kind of 
aggressive and scary, Sunao-san...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:43.680
But you apologized when you felt bad 
about something, and even thanked me.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:48.150
You really are honest about your feelings...

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.340
Just like the meaning of your name.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.950
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.070
Sorry. Was that weird?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.940
<i>He sounded like my brother again...</i>

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.510
You need something?

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.680
Yes.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.840
I didn't ask you over just to apologize.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.550
So, what is it?

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:20.720
Well... I...

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.500
Could...

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:24.660
you and I...

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.980
Will you go out with me?!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:35.380
Um... and you don't mean, like, 
going out on an errand?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.710
Right.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:38.570
You mean in the romantic sense?

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.780
That's right!

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.490
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.120
Listen! My mom says I have to!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.690
The Sumeragi School of swordsmanship 
is supposed to be unparalleled,

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.630
so this is the only way I can still run it!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.630
I lost to you! If I lose, 
I can't inherit the school!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:59.260
So if we get married, we're family, 
and the loss doesn't count!

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:00.410
Okay?!

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:02.930
No, not okay! I mean, marriage?!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.390
If this doesn't work, I'll be punished! 
Disinherited, even!

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.340
So please! Pretend you're 
my boyfriend, just for today!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:13.440
B-But you can't just keep lying to her.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.280
I'm sure if you just apologize...

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.270
Are you crazy?!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:20.530
Every single one of my mom's "punishments" 
are like the wrath of God!

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.860
I'm begging you! Do me this favor!

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.940
Punishment...

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:30.540
Say no and we'll write this off 
by writing <i>you</i> off! Permanently!

00:11:30.930 --> 00:11:32.310
Sunao?

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:35.170
Is there anything wrong?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:40.090
W-Well? How's that feel... K-Kazuya?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.430
F-Feels great... S-Sunao...

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.970
It seems you've figured things out.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:46.810
Yes!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:50.450
We're going to see each 
other romantically.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.990
Kazuya was so glad. Right?

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.050
Do you wanna die?

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.690
I get it, I get it!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:01.670
I'll be going out with Sunao-san.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.490
I hope we have your blessing.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.320
Of course. I'm glad to hear it.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:09.950
See, Mother? We're already this close!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.290
Right, Kazuya? We're not lying, right?!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.250
Right, right, right!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.890
Why, of course.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:20.740
I have complete faith that you're not 
just playing house to placate me.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:25.730
In that case, why don't the two of 
you get to know each other better?

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:30.720
Everything is ready.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:34.930
It's time for some naked intimacy.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:41.990
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:41.990
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.290
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:46.490
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:46.490
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.500
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>.

