Damn.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:02.810
Ow...

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:05.980
Suzuri-san is super strong, as usual.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.510
No one's ever been able 
to score a point on her.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:12.640
I hear if you can land a point on her, 
you'll get to marry into the family.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:13.940
Seriously?!

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:16.530
But I can't imagine being able to best her.

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:18.400
Hey, where's Susumu?

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:23.830
Well, since he never improves, 
practicing with him is a waste of time,

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:25.820
so he's cleaning the place up instead.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.280
That's messed up!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:37.540
It's not like that!

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.920
I'm so sorry, miss!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.810
Only my father has ever been 
able to land a strike on me...

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:56.180
You're going to take responsibility 
for taking my first time.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:14:00.690
And that means becoming a man 
befitting of the Sumeragi School!

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:06.190
<i>And six years later, the two 
of them were happily married.</i>

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.850
It's time for some naked intimacy.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.450
M-Mother?!

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.930
Is this not commonplace 
for young people these days?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:21.710
Or was what you were saying 
about going out just a lie?

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.090
<i>Get in here before she catches on!</i>

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:40.840
Don't look at me!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:41.860
R-Right!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.030
Now, why don't you wash his back?

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:47.890
<i>She's going to watch?!</i>

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:50.060
You'd better not look at me in the mirror!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.120
R-Right...

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:59.390
How did this even happen?

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:02.370
It's your turn to be washed, Sunao.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.450
No way! He's gonna touch me?!

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:06.960
Is there a problem?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:07.880
Well...

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.460
<i>Unacceptable. Absolutely unacceptable!</i>

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:19.040
<i>Even I don't get to bathe 
with Sunao-chan anymore!</i>

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:23.930
<i>And now this worm, whom I don't know 
from a horse's ass, just waltzes in here...</i>

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.930
Hey! Watch the creepy hands.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:26.400
Sorry, they're kind of shaky...

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.530
Whatever, let's just get in the hot water.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.650
<i>Kagami Kazuya.</i>

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:37.660
<i>Once you enter this water, I will 
unleash all my rage on your weak point!</i>

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:42.170
<i>There you are!</i>

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:44.560
<i>Take this!</i>

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:47.190
<i>A Thousand Years of Death!</i>

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.170
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.430
Well, now.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.880
It looks like the bath 
has been contaminated.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:02.380
I guess you two won't 
get to soak after all.

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:03.690
R-Right...

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:12.820
What is this supposed to be?!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:15.320
I've prepared a place for 
you to sleep, of course.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.450
Aren't all young people doing it these days?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:22.540
Or is this talk about going out a lie?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.500
Kazuya... please.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:37.100
You're leaving your clothes on?

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:44.350
Wh-What do we do about this?

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.370
We wait it out.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.990
Give it some time, 
and then say we're finished.

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.480
Makes sense.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.890
Save the pillow talk for 
after you've finished.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:57.750
I'll be waiting out here.

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:04.530
W-We just have to do this!

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:05.860
D-Do what?!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.690
D-Don't be stupid! We'll just be acting!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.470
It just has to sound like we're doing it!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:12.860
U-Uh...

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:13.880
Get on with it!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.070
Come on, come on! 
Oh, yes! Oh, yes!

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.520
Why in English?!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:20.190
I mean, how am I supposed to know?!

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:26.160
I-It's supposed to be like... 
"Can I touch you?" and "You're so pretty."

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.870
That kind of stuff. I think.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.460
O-Okay!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:31.740
Then...

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:32.530
Hey—

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.560
Come on, you have to do it right!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.890
And remember, we're only acting.

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:41.130
Okay... Sunao.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:44.540
You're pretty, Sunao.

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:48.740
Can I touch you?

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:50.450
Y-Yes...

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.800
B-Be gentle.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.060
Does that feel good?

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:00.560
Don't actually touch me!

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.430
Ow!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.900
You're the one who said to do it right!

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:07.510
I didn't mean to... actually...

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.190
You're cute, Sunao.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.950
<i>Something's wrong with me.</i>

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:18.860
Sunao...

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.450
<i>We're only acting...</i>

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:27.090
<i>I know it's just pretend, and yet...</i>

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.340
I love you.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.470
I don't think so!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.930
There you are!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:47.460
Taste my coup de grâce!
Ten Thousand Years of Death!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.100
Eek!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.480
"Eek"?

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:54.480
I'm so sorry, Sunao-chan!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.230
Damn you!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.970
This time I won't miss!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:03.490
You okay?

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.490
He missed my weak points...

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.140
What an unpleasant interruption.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.130
It's okay now. Go right ahead.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:16.330
A-Actually, we already finished.

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.690
Oh, excellent work. That was fast.

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:23.890
Fast...

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:31.900
Sunao.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.060
Let's see here...

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:45.280
It's... still intact.

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:48.790
I see.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.710
The two of you were trying to deceive me.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.420
M-M-Mother! It's not...

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:00.930
Come along, now.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:10.180
It's time for your punishment.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.760
Let me walk you to the gate.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:23.050
Come visit again.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:24.700
Don't listen to her!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:28.950
Damn it, you're going too far.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:31.300
This nonsense about getting 
married because she lost...

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:38.210
When Sunao told me how their duel went, 
it gave me a good impression of him.

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:42.470
The way she described him is 
what gave me that impression.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.380
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:47.580
No way!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.990
I should kill him now, 
while I have the chance—

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:54.690
Don't be rude, now, Susumu-san.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.990
You want to train together 
as malison exorcists?

00:20:56.990 --> 00:21:01.090
Yeah. I need to show Mother that we're 
getting along every now and then.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:04.990
Huh? Do we really need to? 
She already figured out you were lying.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:10.230
I haven't been disinherited yet, 
so the lie is still in effect!

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:11.370
Okay...

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.530
And about that stuff before...

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:18.500
That thing where I said... 
I l-loved you... and kissed you...

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:23.880
All that was, uh... 
just pretend, or like...

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:27.290
It was really convincing.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:30.510
You're a heck of an actress!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.390
I knew the truth, but still got really nervous!

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:35.140
Th...

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.340
Th-That's right, I was acting!

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:40.020
Of course! Don't get the wrong idea, now!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.230
Ow, ow, ow!

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:48.590
Sunao, you're making too much noise.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:24.290
The champion of striking out, 
Shiramine Shirou, has a girlfriend now?!

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:25.390
What we didn't know was

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:29.380
that this freak occurrence would be 
part of a case involving two girls!

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.970
